  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h3> Modular system </h3> <h1> »TMS Core« </h1>",
   "body": "<p>With <strong>»TMS Core«</strong> ZOLLER offers the ideal start point for digital tool management. Streamlined, with an overview, and ready to use immediately – perfect for structuring processes and centrally storing tool data. With TMS, you remain flexible at all times: browser-based, available across locations, and simple to scale – suitable for any level of production. If desired, »TMS Core« can be expanded at any time with six add-ons – exactly at the pace at which your tool management should grow.</p> <p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/en_DE/company/contact\">Request now</a> <a href=\"https://myzoller.com/us/en/expert/booking/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">1:1 expert meeting</a></p>",
   "images": [
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/7/b/csm_TMSCore_product_c0b310efb0.webp",
     "alt": "",
     "w": 1080,
     "h": 852
    }
   ],
