   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h3> »TMS Core« </h3> <h2> Growth potential </h2>",
   "body": "<p class=\"large-text\">The software is specifically designed for expandability: Start today, expand tomorrow – with the add-ons, that your tool management really needs. </p> <p class=\"large-text\">Thanks to centralized data storage, »TMS Core« reduces administrative overhead. </p> <p class=\"large-text\">»TMS Core« ensures that tool data can be created once and used everywhere.</p>",
